  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2027.1.5: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.4: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.3: new Nova controls NovaSlider and NovaRangeSlider, NovaChip, NovaTag, NovaBadge, NovaSnackbar, NovaNavigationDrawer, NovaNavigationRail and NovaNavigationTop (NovaNavigationItem, NovaNavigationHeader), NovaAvatar and NovaAvatarGroup, NovaSkeleton, NovaImageUpload, NovaFloatingActionBar (NovaFloatingActionBarItem). Their colors are in NovaWpf.Styles 2027.1.3. 2027.1.2: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.1: new Nova controls NovaAccordionGroup, NovaAutocomplete, NovaCard, NovaDataGridSelection (check box selection of a DataGrid), NovaFilePicker, NovaInlineBanner, NovaLink, NovaList, NovaPagination, NovaSearch, NovaStepper, NovaTextField and NovaTimePicker. NovaBanner, NovaBreadcrumbs, NovaSegmentedButton, NovaSideSheet (Esc, focus, commands), NovaCircularProgress (48 px, screen reader value) and the other controls follow the Nova specs and the keyboard and screen reader guidance. Needs NovaWpf.Styles 2027.1.3 for the new colors.",
